<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'XSS Lab Series - Dashboard', currentLab: 'home' }) %>

<div class="lab-banner">
  <div class="lab-meta">
    <span class="lab-pill">Training Environment</span>
    <span>PortSwigger-Inspired Lab Series</span>
  </div>
  <h1 class="lab-title">Web Security Training: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)</h1>
  <p class="lab-description">
    Pelajari mekanisme Cross-Site Scripting (Reflected, Stored, dan DOM-based) melalui serangkaian lab tantangan CTF yang realistis dalam lingkungan terisolasi.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2 class="card-title">Available Labs</h2>
  <div class="lab-grid">
    <div class="lab-card">
      <div>
        <div class="lab-card-num">Lab 01</div>
        <h3 class="lab-card-title">Reflected XSS into HTML context with nothing encoded</h3>
        <p class="lab-card-desc">
          Fitur pencarian blog memantulkan input pengguna langsung ke respon HTML tanpa proses sanitasi atau contextual encoding.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/lab01" class="btn btn-primary">Start Lab 01 &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-card">
      <div>
        <div class="lab-card-num">Lab 02</div>
        <h3 class="lab-card-title">Stored XSS into HTML context with nothing encoded</h3>
        <p class="lab-card-desc">
          Form komentar blog menyimpan input ke dalam database SQLite dan merendernya kembali ke pengunjung tanpa output encoding.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/lab02" class="btn btn-primary">Start Lab 02 &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-card">
      <div>
        <div class="lab-card-num">Lab 03</div>
        <h3 class="lab-card-title">DOM XSS in document.write sink using location.search</h3>
        <p class="lab-card-desc">
          Skrip analitik pelacak menulis elemen gambar ke DOM menggunakan document.write dari parameter query tanpa sanitasi.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/lab03" class="btn btn-primary">Start Lab 03 &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-card">
      <div>
        <div class="lab-card-num">Lab 04</div>
        <h3 class="lab-card-title">DOM XSS in innerHTML sink using location.search</h3>
        <p class="lab-card-desc">
          Pencarian blog dinamis memperbarui elemen header hasil pencarian melalui innerHTML dari parameter query tanpa sanitasi.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/lab04" class="btn btn-primary">Start Lab 04 &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-card">
      <div>
        <div class="lab-card-num">Lab 05</div>
        <h3 class="lab-card-title">DOM XSS in jQuery anchor href sink using location.search</h3>
        <p class="lab-card-desc">
          Halaman feedback menggunakan jQuery lokal untuk mengatur atribut href tombol Back dari parameter returnPath tanpa validasi skema URL.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/lab05" class="btn btn-primary">Start Lab 05 &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-card">
      <div>
        <div class="lab-card-num">Lab 06</div>
        <h3 class="lab-card-title">DOM XSS in jQuery selector sink using hashchange</h3>
        <p class="lab-card-desc">
          Daftar postingan blog menggunakan jQuery $() selector dengan :contains() pada event hashchange tanpa sanitasi input.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/lab06" class="btn btn-primary">Start Lab 06 &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-card" style="border: 2px dashed #93c5fd; background-color: #f8fafc;">
      <div>
        <div class="lab-card-num" style="color: var(--accent-color);">Tooling</div>
        <h3 class="lab-card-title">Challenge Helper Page</h3>
        <p class="lab-card-desc">
          Server pembantu origin terpisah untuk menyimpan dokumen HTML payload/iframe pemicu (maks 10 KB) bagi peserta CTF.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/helper" class="btn btn-secondary">Open Helper &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
